text:
[Doc: C6CUSTOMERCAREESC-D2 | Category: Customer Care & Escalations | Title: VIP and enterprise priority support tier]
Use impact, breadth, time criticality and contractual SLA. Critical business-wide outage or safety/security event receives urgent routing;

standard tier requests remain visible and are not silently abandoned.

[Doc: C7B2BCORPORATETRADE-D10 | Category: B2B Corporate & Trade | Title: B2B dispute resolution and commercial arbitration]
Assign a commercial owner and obtain operational, finance and legal facts. Separate service recovery from admissions of breach;

settlement proposals require delegated authority and confidentiality review.
